  Facts:
  - text: "Clownfish live in a special partnership with sea anemones\u2014stinging
      creatures that protect the clownfish from danger.\nBut guess what? The clownfish
      doesn\u2019t get stung! It has a slimy coat that keeps it safe.\nThey clean
      the anemone, and the anemone keeps predators away.\nBest friends forever under
      the sea!"
